              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="a1eb-0258-504f-a2f2">This model can perform a Heroic Intervention if there are any enemy units within 6&quot; of them instead of 3&quot;, and when doing so can move up to 6&quot; instead of 3&quot;. In addition, each time this Keeper of Secrets consolidates, it can move up to D3+3&quot; instead of 3.</characteristic>
