        <profile name="Doom Siren" typeId="10e3-235b-fd89-87a6" typeName="Abillities" hidden="false" id="7445-226f-f2d5-678f">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="a1eb-0258-504f-a2f2">In your Shooting phase, after this model&apos;s unit has shot, select one enemy Infantry unit hit by one or more of those attacks and roll three D6: for each 4+, that enemy unit suffers 1 mortal wound. If an enemy suffers one or more mortal wounds as a result of this ability, it must take a Battle-shock test.</characteristic>
