        <profile name="Euphoric Strikes" typeId="10e3-235b-fd89-87a6" typeName="Abillities" hidden="false" id="b758-c562-fe35-4f99">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="a1eb-0258-504f-a2f2">Once per battle, at the start of the Fight phase, this model can use this ability. If it does so, until the end of the phase, add 3 to the Attacks characteristic of melee weapons equipped by this model and improve the Armour Penetration characteristic of those weapons by 1.</characteristic>
